  "title": "Mom's Spiced Pumpkin Pie",
  "description": "This is a spicier version of pumpkin pie. This recipe has been in our family for over 50 years and is always much enjoyed at holiday meals. The fresher your spices, the better this will taste! Serve with whipped topping, if desired.",
  "authors": [
